<BaseLayout title="Vijay Bhoyar" description="Factual project role, authorship scope, disclosure, external records, and current work for AI Amigos.">
  <div class="shell reading"><p class="eyebrow">Project lead and method author</p><h1>Vijay Bhoyar</h1><p class="lede">Vijay Bhoyar directs the AI Amigos project and is the named author of its current working evidence specifications.</p><div class="notice"><strong>Bounded profile:</strong> this page does not claim independent recognition, top-level standing, professional licensure, external review, or qualifications that have not been linked to issuer-controlled evidence.</div><h2>Defined work</h2><p>The current work focuses on privacy-preserving methods for testing AI-assisted workflows, documenting human decisions, measuring follow-up outcomes, and publishing comparable evidence only after review and privacy gates pass.</p><h2>Published contribution record</h2><ul><li><a href="/methods/ai-workflow-evidence-protocol/">AI Workflow Evidence Protocol 0.1.0</a></li><li><a href="/methods/proof-pack-specification/">AI Proof Pack Specification 0.1.0</a></li><li><a href="/methods/comparable-outcome-benchmark-method/">Comparable Outcome Benchmark Method 0.1.0</a></li></ul><h2>External records</h2><p>The source repository is available on <a href="https://github.com/vijay-v-bhoyar/aiamigos" rel="external">GitHub</a>. Additional institutional, publication, professional, or persistent-identifier profiles will be added only after their ownership and accuracy are verified.</p><h2>Disclosure</h2><p>AI tools may assist with drafting, implementation, testing, and source organization. Vijay remains responsible for publication decisions. Internal authorship and editorial review are not described as independent recognition.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Report an incorrect attribution, date, scope, or external record through the <a href="/contact/">correction channel</a>.</p></div>
